invariant: INV-62
file: src/mldsa_signer.c
catches: mldsa_signer_test_host
reason: a host object's signer leaves the NTT of s1, s2 and t0 on the
  stack after the signature: 23 polynomials that the frame held for every
  round (docs/decisions.md 191). bin/mldsa_signer_test_host searches the
  stack below the call for two coefficients of six of them and finds
  them.

--- old
    ct_wipe(&st, sizeof st);
    ct_wipe(&ex.key, sizeof ex.key);
--- new
    ct_wipe(&st, sizeof st);
